ase after shaking; CW is the concentration of complexes in the aqueous phase after shaking; C is the concentration of stock solution."}],"melting_points":[{"temperature_c":"79.5–81.0","event":"Melting point","Counterion":"F[P-](F)(F)(F)(F)F","source":"10.1016/j.jinorgbio.2024.112778","source_page":"PDF p. 13","notes":"","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jinorgbio.2024.112778"}]}